    "title": "Deadline to apply for SCCSD Board of Directors is Thursday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reilly Mahon Maren Ewertz ,\n37 minutes ago\nSIOUX CITY , Iowa ( KCAU ) — There is still time for people to file paperwork to run for the Sioux City Community School District’s (SCCSD) Board of Directors.\nThe deadline is Thursday, Sept. 18, by 5 p.m.\nStory continues below\nDistrict officials said that after 5 p.m., they will release a full list of candidates’ names that will be on the November 4 ballot. There are three full-term seats ready to be filled.\nYou can find more details about how to run and what other documents you need to submit on the SCCSD website .\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to SiouxlandProud | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
